          "description": "Frontend Engineer / Developer – React, TypeScript, Next.js & Node.js\nEmployment: W2 – Full-Time\nLocation: Onsite / Hybrid / Remote – United States, based on client requirements\nAbout the Role:\nPrecision Technologies Corp. is seeking skilled Frontend Engineers / Developers to build responsive, scalable, high-performance web applications using modern JavaScript technologies.\nKey Skills: React.js, TypeScript, Next.js, Node.js, JavaScript (ES6+), HTML5, CSS3, responsive UI development, REST APIs, Git, and frontend performance optimization.\nRequirements: Hands-on experience building modern web applications, reusable UI components, API integrations, and responsive interfaces. Strong debugging, problem-solving, and collaboration skills are essential.\nEmployment & Eligibility:\nW2 / Full-Time employment with PTC.\nOnsite, hybrid, or remote opportunities across the United States, depending on client requirements.\nOpen to candidates with valid U.S. work authorization; H-1B candidates are not eligible.\nCareer-break candidates with relevant skills and experience are welcome.\nMahesh Kyadari, Team Lead - Talent Management Lead\nmaheshk@precisiontechcorp.com",
