          "description": "About the Company\nUSAble Life is hiring for Developer I and Developer II positions.\nAbout the Role\nThe Developer I/II role involves analyzing, developing, implementing, maintaining, and testing software applications across company systems. Candidates should have an educational background in Computer Science or Information Systems and at least one year of IT experience.\nKey Responsibilities\nAnalyze software applications and identify development requirements.\nDevelop and implement software applications across company systems.\nMaintain existing applications and support their ongoing functionality.\nTest software applications to help ensure they operate as expected.\nRequired Qualifications\nDegree in Computer Science (CS) or Information Systems (IS).\nAt least one year of IT experience.\nPreferred Qualifications\nSkills or experience with Git.\nSkills or experience with SQL.\nCompensation and Benefits\nThe position offers a performance-based incentive plan.\nPay transparency information includes base compensation ranges and potential bonuses for Web Developer I and Web Developer II roles.\nWork Arrangement\nRemote opportunities are available.\nEquipment is provided for the role.",
