          "description": "WordPress/ CMS Web Developer Required (Intermediate Experience)\nCandidates looking for work-from-home/hybrid roles and those based outside Karachi will be REJECTED.\nIMMEDIATE JOINING\nThis is a full-time, onsite role.\nLocation: Gulshan-e-Iqbal, Block 3, Karachi\nTimings: 8 PM – 4 AM, Mon–Fri\nRequirements:\nIntermediate-level web development experience\nStrong proficiency in WordPress\nExperience with Wix, Squarespace, Kajabi or similar CMS platforms\nGood knowledge of HTML, CSS and basic JavaScript\nExperience with themes, plugins and page builders\nUnderstanding of responsive design and basic SEO\nGood problem-solving skills and attention to detail\nGood written and verbal English\nRole Overview:\nDevelop and maintain websites using WordPress and other CMS platforms\nCustomize themes, plugins, layouts and website functionality\nBuild responsive and user-friendly web pages\nHandle website updates, fixes and troubleshooting\nWork with designers and project managers to deliver client websites\nTest websites and ensure functionality across devices\nApply Now: hr@amgdigital.solutions",
