          "description": "Job Purpose\nWe are looking for a highly skilled Java Developer with strong experience in Spring Boot and Microservices architecture. The ideal candidate will design, develop, and maintain scalable backend services in a cloud-native environment.\nKey Result Areas\n• Design and develop RESTful APIs using Java 8/11/17\n• Build microservices using Spring Boot\n• Implement service-to-service communication (REST, Kafka, etc.)\n• Work with relational and NoSQL databases\n• Write clean, testable, production-grade code\n• Participate in architecture discussions and technical design\n• Implement security using JWT/OAuth2\n• Optimize application performance and scalability\n• Follow CI/CD and DevOps practices\n• Troubleshoot production issues and perform root cause analysis\nKnowledge, Skills and Experience\n• Strong experience in Java & OOP concepts\n• Hands-on experience with Spring Boot\n• Experience building Microservices architecture\n• Experience with REST APIs\n• Database experience (SQL, PostgreSQL, Oracle, MongoDB)\n• Understanding of Docker & Kubernetes\nExperience with Git\n• Familiarity with CI/CD pipelines",
