          "description": "About the Company\nUSAble Life is seeking web development professionals to support the design and development of software applications that serve its systems and customers.\nAbout the Role\nUSAble Life is hiring Web Developer I/II professionals for fully remote positions. In these roles, you will design, develop, implement, and test software applications while working with analysts and senior developers to understand requirements and deliver solutions across multiple projects.\nThe positions require knowledge of modern web technologies, SQL databases, and secure coding practices. They also offer opportunities for professional growth, pay progression, and participation in company incentives.\nKey Responsibilities\nDesign and develop software applications that support company systems and customers.\nImplement and test software solutions to meet project requirements.\nWork with analysts and senior developers to gather and clarify requirements.\nContribute to multiple projects and support the delivery of timely, cost-effective solutions.\nApply modern web development technologies and SQL database knowledge in software development.\nFollow secure coding practices when developing and testing applications.\nRequired Qualifications\nKnowledge of modern web technologies.\nKnowledge of SQL databases.\nUnderstanding of secure coding practices.\nAbility to work with analysts and senior developers to clarify requirements and support project delivery.\nSalary & Benefits\nThe positions offer opportunities for pay progression and company incentives. Specific salary figures and individual benefit details were not provided in the listing.\nLocation and Work Arrangement\nThese positions are fully remote.",
