      "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/career-pals_jobsearch-remotejobs-activity-7520107030716645377-kMP8": {
        "fetched_at": "2026-10-30T22:29:49.057015+00:00",
        "payload": {
          "status": "active",
          "text": "Job digest 10/25/2026 by LiftmyCV: Top companies hiring remote ai jobs\n• neurohire ai – AI/ML Engineer\n• Melotech – AI/ML Engineer\n• Lingaro – AI/ML Engineer\n• EUROPEAN DYNAMICS – Junior AI/ML Engineer - Python Developer\n• Lingaro – ML/AI Engineer\n\nCheck the comments to learn how to apply 👇\n\n#jobsearch #remotejobs",
